      <!-- 7. CENTRAL GREENERY DINING ISLAND (GROUP_CENTER: Central planter + 4 dining tables + 8 chairs) -->
      <!-- Dimensions based on drawing measurements: -->
      <!--   - Virtual circle center: X = -3.195m, Y = -0.140m (translated north 1.28m together with the north cluster) -->
      <!--   - Virtual circle radius: R = 1.95m (2mm visual floor marker, no collision) -->
      <!--   - CENTRAL SQUARE PLANTER: Side 0.89m x 0.89m x height 0.50m at center (-3.195, -0.140), with a tree of height 2.1m -->
      <!--   - 4 standard Group 01 dining tables (0.67m x 1.38m x 0.75m), at this exact distance from planter edge: 0.30m: -->
      <!--     * North table: Center (-3.195, 0.940, 0.375), length 1.38m along axis X, 2 Chair north at Y = 1.436m -->
      <!--     * South table: Center (-3.195, -1.220, 0.375), length 1.38m along axis X, 2 Chair south at Y = -1.716m -->
      <!--     * East table: Center (-2.115, -0.140, 0.375), length 1.38m along axis Y, 2 Chair east at X = -1.619m -->
      <!--     * West table: Center (-4.275, -0.140, 0.375), length 1.38m along axis Y, 2 Chair west at X = -4.771m -->
      <!--   - Each table has 2 standard Group 01 dining chairs (0.28m x 0.28m x 0.75m) placed symmetrically on the outside -->
