      <!-- 8. CIRCULAR DINING CLUSTER NORTH (North cluster of 3 Group 01 sets - Centered between the two black north-wall pillars) -->
      <!-- Dimensions based on drawing measurements: -->
      <!--   - Virtual circle center: X = -3.898m, Y = 4.910m (centered between the two black north-wall pillars: Pillar NW X=-8.445m & Pillar NE X=0.650m) -->
      <!--   - Virtual circle radius: R = 1.95m (2mm visual floor marker, no collision) -->
      <!--   - 3 Group 01 sets spaced 120 degrees around the center (table-edge distance from center 0.50m, table-center distance from circle center 1.19m): -->
      <!--     * North table: Center (-3.898, 6.100, 0.375), length 1.38m along Y, width 0.67m along X (0.67m short edge flush against north wall Y = 6.790m), yaw = 0 -->
      <!--     * Southwest table: Center (-4.929, 4.315, 0.375), rotated 120 degrees (yaw = 2.0944 rad) -->
